  stickyNoteInfos:
  - title: Page Turn Direction
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: -15
      y: -719
      width: 646
      height: 311
    contents: "In order to set the direction of the turn, a TurnDuration SpawnEvent Attribute is set, as positive for a TurnLeft operation, or negative for a TurnRight operation. \n\nThe sign of this duration is then used in the VFX to determine the state and the animation."
    theme: 
    textSize: Medium
    colorTheme: 1
  - title: Page Turn Direction
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: -2333
      y: 582
      width: 445
      height: 311
    contents: '

      The Age/Lifetime ratio is inverted (1-x) when performing the TurnRight animation based on the TurnDirection attribute.



      In this case we only check the sign of the animation.'
    theme: 
    textSize: Medium
    colorTheme: 1
  - title: Duration & Direction
    position:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 222
      y: 307
      width: 646
      height: 217
    contents: 'The absolute value of the source Lifetime attribute (set in Spawn) is used (so it ignores the direction).


      The TurnDirection attribute is set to the sign of the source lifetime attribute.'
    theme: 
    textSize: Medium
    colorTheme: 1
  categories: []
  uiBounds:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: -2358
